# The Beast's Lair — forest T3 basic striker
# Arc-launched (the_lodge): killing it here sets the_lodge.beast_defeated,
# which closes the [requires] gate on the roaming the_beast road fight.

[title The Beast's Lair]
[image monsters/swamp_beast_4.png]
[background forest/forest_tier_3_1]
[blood #2a4a3a]
[stats hp=24]

* move Tainted Attack
  narration: It lunges forward, black jaws splitting wider than they should.

* move Terrifying Attack
  narration: All at once the creature is upon you, overwhelming your defenses with hammering blows

* move Defend
  narration: It recoils back, head hunched low.

* move Heavy Power Recover
  narration: The creature finds renewed strength, far beyond anything natural.

* intro
The cold breath of the hollow closes over you as you reach the bottom. The
dark under the far wall moves. It does not circle, does not test you; it has
done all of that already, on the roads, in the brush. It rises from a bed of
fern and old bones and turns its ichor-filled maw toward you. Neither of you
is going to run this time.

* win
+give_gold 12
+add_tag the_lodge.beast_defeated
+chain "The Lodge"
The creature crouches to attack again, then, all at once, it collapses with a
heavy thud. Whatever force animated this monster is gone, and all that remains
is its ragged corpse.

* lose
Your wounds overwhelm you, you collapse to the forest floor.
